&lt;h2 id="template-functions-模板函数-1">Template Functions 模板函数&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#template-functions-%e6%a8%a1%e6%9d%bf%e5%87%bd%e6%95%b0-1" aria-label="Heading self-link">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Beego supports custom template functions but it must be set as below before &lt;code>web.Run()&lt;/code>:&lt;/p>
